# Python 3.9 dev/test tooling for the ci.yml python job.
#
# Split from ci-dev-py3.in because a resolution for 3.9 is not the same as one
# for 3.13, and the wheels have to exist for the interpreter that installs them
# (3.9 is the abi3 floor the wheel is built against).
#
# Locked output: ci-dev-py39.txt. Refresh via scripts/update-lockfiles.sh.
maturin
# No pytest here, deliberately. pytest 9.x requires Python 3.10, so this row
# could only ever pin 8.4.2 -- below the fix for GHSA-6w46-j5rx-g56g, with no
# 8.x backport. Keeping a vulnerable package pinned to run tests that never
# needed it is the wrong trade, so the 3.9 row runs
# bindings/python/tests/run_without_pytest.py instead: the same modules, plain
# functions with plain asserts, on the floor interpreter.
